= Ignacy Daszyński

Daszyński represents Centrum PPS and specializes in parliamentary negotiation.

- @parliamentary_compromise
- @broker_coalition
- @root: Return to main

@parliamentary_compromise
title: Parliamentary Compromise
subtitle: Relations: PSL Piast +5, NPR +5, PSChD +4. A toleration still needs a candidate, a programme and real support.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.advisorActionStatus(Q, 'daszynski', 'parliamentary_compromise').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_advact_parliamentary_compromise_why +]
call: polish_advisor_commit
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisorAction(Q, 'daszynski', 'parliamentary_compromise');
!}

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.

@broker_coalition
title: Broker a Coalition
subtitle: In a coalition, reduce the tension of each cabinet agreement by 10; or add 5 to the partners' evaluation of one broad cabinet offer in preparation.
choose-if: {! return Q.advisor_action_timer <= 0 && PolishGovernment.brokerStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer = 1 : 1 month before the next Committee action. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 1 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next Committee action. ?][? if advisor_action_timer <= 0 : Needs PPS in a coalition with a cabinet agreement under tension, or a broad cabinet offer in preparation. ?]
call: polish_advisor_commit
on-arrival: {!
// Technical reference 10.4.3: one mode, no free relation change and no bypass of the crisis gate.
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
Q.pl_broker_mode = PolishGovernment.brokerCoalition(Q);
!}

[? if pl_broker_mode = "tension" : Daszyński eases the disputes inside the coalition: the tension of each cabinet agreement falls by 10. A broken promise stays broken. ?][? if pl_broker_mode = "broad_offer" : Daszyński prepares the ground for our broad cabinet offer: its partners weigh it 5 points more favourably. ?]
